d grey ribbed tank top cropped above the waist, high-waisted blue denim jeans, a black leather shoulder bag worn on her right shoulder, holding a blue mini handbag and a blue-and-yellow plaid shirt draped over her left arm, with her right hand casually tucked into her jean pocket.\n\n<Subject 2> is the MTR subway station environment in <Picture 2>: a prominent cylindrical pillar covered in yellow square tiles on the upper half and green square tiles on the lower half, with bold black Chinese characters \"尖沙咀\" and English letters \"Tsim Sha Tsui\" mounted on the yellow section, a grey speckled terrazzo floor, and a blurred subway train and platform visible in the background.\n\nsummary:\n\n[reference generation] The target video is a 10-second four-shot atmospheric subway-station \"commute\" vlog of <Subject 1> in front of <Subject 2>, featuring candid micro-gestures - adjusting her shoulder bag strap, shifting the plaid shirt on her arm, tucking a strand of hair behind her ear, a playful shrug, and a warm direct-to-camera smile - with bright overhead station lighting, handheld filmic texture, and no dialogue.\n\nretention_analysis:\n\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, short brown bob with wispy bangs, natural makeup, grey ribbed tank top, blue jeans, black shoulder bag, blue mini handbag, and blue-and-yellow plaid shirt are retained.\n\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the yellow and green tiled pillar, the black \"尖沙咀\" and \"Tsim Sha Tsui\" lettering, and the grey terrazzo floor keep their positions, appearance, and legibility unchanged; the background subway elements remain blurred but fixed.\n\ndetailed_description:\n\nThe target video uses a handheld filmic vlog style with soft halation, gentle film grain, shallow depth of field, and bright, slightly cool overhead subway lighting. Global rules: no dialogue; every gesture is prop-free and hands return to a natural rest between gestures; the pillar layout stays fixed and no prop ever moves except where explicitly described; a gentle station breeze stirs her hair in every shot.\n\n[Shot 1] The video opens dreamy and slightly defocused with gentle halation, then racks into sharp focus within the first second. A medium shot shows <Subject 1> standing on the terrazzo floor in front of the yellow and green tiled pillar of <Subject 2>, one hand in her pocket, the other holding the plaid shirt and blue bag. She looks directly into the lens with a bright, expectant smile. Noticing the camera, she tilts her head slightly and shifts her weight, her bangs swaying gently. The \"尖沙咀\" lettering glows brightly behind her. End state: <Subject 1> facing the camera, smiling, feet planted on the floor, hands resting naturally.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the shot cuts to a handheld follow shot: the camera backs up as <Subject 1> takes a small step forward and turns her body slightly, shifting the blue-and-yellow plaid shirt from her left arm to drape over her shoulder. She adjusts the black leather shoulder bag strap with her right hand, then looks down with a soft chuckle. The overhead station lights catch the sheen of her grey tank top. On the pillar behind her, the black \"Tsim Sha Tsui\" letters stay legible and unchanged. End state: <Subject 1> standing beside the pillar, hands back at her sides, looking up with a playful smile.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot in front of the yellow tiled pillar. <Subject 1> turns back to face the camera directly, clasping both hands behind her back while still holding the blue bag and plaid shirt. She leans her upper body slightly forward, gives a small playful shrug with a pouty grin that breaks into a mischievous smile, and tilts her head. Warm rim light outlines her bob against the yellow tiles; the \"尖沙咀\" characters remain visible at the edge of the frame. End state: <Subject 1> leaning slightly forward, hands clasped behind her back, head tilted, smiling at the camera.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the shot cuts to a quiet close-up; the yellow tiles of the pillar glow softly behind her in shallow focus. She lifts her right hand and tucks a loose strand of hair behind her ear, her eyes drifting toward the camera with a dreamy, absent look. Her gaze then locks onto the lens; she gives one soft blink and a faint closed-lip smile blooms with a small head tilt to the other side, a loose strand drifting across her cheek. She holds this gentle expression steady until the final frame. End state: close-up, hand lowered out of frame, faint smile, eyes resting on the lens.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nQuiet subway station ambience throughout: a soft hum of distant train engines, a muffled station announcement, footsteps echoing on terrazzo pavement, a gentle rustle of the plaid shirt shifting on her arm in [Shot 2], and the soft friction of denim as she shifts her weight in [Shot 3].\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nA bright, nostalgic indie-pop cue: light electronic beats with a fingerpicked acoustic guitar and a soft wordless vocal hum; it swells gently through the playful shrug moment in [Shot 3] and thins out to a single sparse synth line under the final close-up, keeping a dreamy, tender, and urban mood."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [410, 640], "pos": [-2600, 5960], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "SIGMAS", "links": [330], "label": "Sigmas", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "Sigmas"}], "size": [360, 110], "pos": [148.7041015625, 5500], "widgets_values": ["beta", 6, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 333, "label